Third-party art
---------------
The pixel art in static/ and tools/art/ is by GandalfHardcore
(https://gandalfhardcore.itch.io/) and from the ChestPack asset pack, used
under their creators' licences. Those licences allow the art to be used
inside this project only: the images may not be extracted, redistributed,
resold or repackaged on their own or as part of another asset collection.
